{
"Items.TearingRing.Desc": "An iridescent crimson ring faintly humming with magical energy. It was skillfully fashioned from meteorite ore, giving it an almost ethereal feel. Remarkably when worn, it slows down the healing of inflicted wounds on opponents, even on the toughest creature. "
"Items.TearingRing.Long": "an iridescent crimson ring"
"Items.TearingRing.Short": "Tearing Ring"
}
